From 5d543c494eabd3ff015fd9a26d5cf6d0c0c2b9db Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ludovic Henry <git@ludovic.dev>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 10:29:47 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Ship tblite's and its bundled dependencies' licences in the
 wheel

`license.text` is the legacy table form, and meson-python only writes
`dist-info/licenses/` for files listed in `project.license-files` (it has
no default glob), so the published wheels carry no licence text at all:
not tblite's own LGPL-3.0 COPYING/COPYING.LESSER, not those of the meson
subprojects statically linked into `_libtblite` (dftd4, s-dftd3 and ddx
under LGPL-3.0; mctc-lib, mstore, multicharge, jonquil and toml-f under
Apache-2.0/MIT), and not that of the reference LAPACK/BLAS libraries
`auditwheel repair` vendors into `tblite.libs/`.

Switch to the PEP 639 SPDX `license` string and list every one of those
files. The subproject paths resolve because meson-python configures the
project (downloading the wraps) before it validates the metadata, and
they are part of the `--include-subprojects` sdist. LICENSE.lapack is
Reference-LAPACK v3.12.0's LICENSE, the version of the manylinux_2_39
image's lapack/blas packages (3.12.0-7.el10).

Upstream-Status: To upstream [not submitted from this automated port run; needs a pull request against tblite/tblite]
---
 python/LICENSE.lapack | 48 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 python/pyproject.toml | 17 ++++++++++++++-
 2 files changed, 64 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)
 create mode 100644 python/LICENSE.lapack

diff --git a/python/LICENSE.lapack b/python/LICENSE.lapack
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..96b04c9
--- /dev/null
+++ b/python/LICENSE.lapack
@@ -0,0 +1,48 @@
